    "When an account’s weekly Fable allowance is spent and usage credits are off, Claude stops and asks. herdrm answers “Switch to … and continue”. Applies to every device with grazr, while herdrm is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
